    "title_en": "Genus 4 Supermoduli Space Is Not Projected",
    "abstract_en": "The supermoduli stack ${\\mathfrak M}_g$, parametrizing smooth unpunctured super Riemann surfaces of genus $g$, is known to be non-projected for $g \\ge 5$. We extend this result to the even-spin component of ${\\mathfrak M}_4$. This is done by exhibiting an appropriate compact curve in the spin moduli space ${\\mathcal S\\mathcal M}_4^{+}$, and computing the restriction to it of the class obstructing the projectedness of ${\\mathfrak M}_4^{+}$. This restriction turns out to be non-zero, proving that ${\\mathfrak M}_4^{+}$ is non-projected.",
